#: ../installation/preparation.rst:7 51dcafb20f1840d1b10c97e72f0a5910
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "Priprava"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:9 bda37b0b74344a7b8f09bf8d9070f8f1
msgid ""
"You have to follow some preparation steps for Galette installation. The way "
"to go differs on what you want to achieve."
msgstr ""
"Za namestitev Galette morate slediti nekaj pripravljalnim korakom. Postopek "
"se razlikuje glede na to, kaj želite doseči."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:14 1bd15f9d221b452eae9cd5079fa3bb85
msgid "File permissions"
msgstr "Dovoljenja za datoteke"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:18 78b8168b92c546d6926410b83fbe0980
msgid ""
"A commonly used hack is to give all rights to everyone recursively on the "
"directory (``chmod 777``). This is a very very bad idea from a security "
"point of view. Please do not use that hack, you've been warned ;)"
msgstr ""
"Pogosto uporabljen trik je rekurzivno podelitev vseh pravic vsem v imeniku "
"(``chmod 777``). Z varnostnega vidika je to zelo, zelo slaba ideja. Prosim, "
"ne uporabljajte tega trika, bili ste opozorjeni ;)"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:20 2f1812a13fe24951914f5c73e0a6f3c0
msgid ""
"Some Galette directories need specific rights. The application will need to "
"write in some of them, you have to ensure it will be possible. Here are "
"directories that need a write access:"
msgstr ""
"Nekateri imeniki Galette zahtevajo posebne pravice. Aplikacija bo morala "
"pisati v nekatere od njih, zato morate zagotoviti, da bo to mogoče. Tukaj so "
"imeniki, ki potrebujejo dostop za pisanje:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:22 68f8193a687f4bfb86fac9069da5709f
msgid "|folder| `config` [#configdirperms]_,"
msgstr "|folder| `config` [#configdirperms]_,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:23 a4fee9f341e84fe2a18fe653c4412b62
msgid "|folder| `data/attachments`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/attachments`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:24 94389befec0b4337a8234e446320839b
msgid "|folder| `data/cache`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/cache`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:25 0ff1158240b64ae8b5af38a1701b8e8d
msgid "|folder| `data/exports`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/exports`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:26 6c8792b149e4463182464a63e8a4c7f5
msgid "|folder| `data/files`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/files`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:27 80eeb54e2383458992a4f93e42bec520
msgid "|folder| `data/imports`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/imports`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:28 6ed8148ff2904c5fa12a25a0d3c1dc9e
msgid "|folder| `data/logs`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/logs`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:29 3077c5368bc9453884122188eb2fc9da
msgid "|folder| `data/photos`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/photos`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:30 1e95d27444d64c3eb6c33b010b71a2bc
msgid "|folder| `data/tempimages`,"
msgstr "|folder| `data/tempimages`,"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:31 42955539a0924c8c9df33a1ac3615fde
msgid "|folder| `data/templates_c`"
msgstr "|folder| `data/templates_c`"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:33 5dc21b3bb5684fa0acbcd7dbb50bffbd
msgid ""
"write access on ``config`` directory is only needed for Galette "
"installation, we advice you to remove the write access once Galette has been "
"installed :)"
msgstr ""
"Dostop za pisanje v imenik ``config`` je potreben samo za namestitev "
"Galette, svetujemo vam, da po namestitvi Galette dostop za pisanje "
"odstranite :)"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:36 51df105ac3fe4877877872eedcef3bd8
msgid "Create database"
msgstr "Ustvari bazo podatkov"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:40 864c7a4113254a78a7ec40a539872374
msgid "**Never use database root user!**"
msgstr "**Nikoli ne uporabljajte uporabnika root baze podatkov!**"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:42 d747cf679ba04f6c80192b7ae5eceddc
msgid ""
"For security reasons, it is strongly advised to rely on a specific user for "
"Galette database, and give him only requested access on the single Galette "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Zaradi varnostnih razlogov je zelo priporočljivo, da se za podatkovno zbirko "
"Galette zanesete na določenega uporabnika in mu omogočite dostop le do ene "
"same podatkovne zbirke Galette."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:44 446bdbfd3c4743f68ceb9ae87ac33781
msgid ""
"For the example, we will use a database named `mygalette` with a user "
"`mygaletteuser` with `mypass` as password."
msgstr ""
"Za primer bomo uporabili bazo podatkov z imenom `mygalette` z uporabnikom "
"`mygaletteuser` in geslom `mypass`."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:46 538dd8d442b3431caa303a66d63f0325
msgid "MariaDB"
msgstr "MariaDB"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:55 c3e41a6e3b504aa0a5f243351ada9c83
msgid "PostgreSQL"
msgstr "PostgreSQL"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:64 471836a366e149fca9402da26a1d2498
msgid ""
"Those commands may vary, please refer to `MariaDB <https://mariadb.com/kb/en/"
"library/documentation/>`_ or `PostgreSQL <https://docs.postgresqlfr.org>`_ "
"documentations, or use a graphical tool:"
msgstr ""
"Ti ukazi se lahko razlikujejo, prosimo, glejte dokumentacijo `MariaDB "
"<https://mariadb.com/kb/en/library/documentation/>`_ ali `PostgreSQL "
"<https://docs.postgresqlfr.org>`_ ali uporabite grafično orodje:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:66 016c5a5d6c154041b6d9c8a67fa527c0
msgid "`phpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net>`_ for MariaDB ;"
msgstr "`phpMyAdmin <https://www.phpmyadmin.net>`_ za MariaDB;"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:67 377d2294f1564611b893565aa0db7645
msgid ""
"`phpPgAdmin <http://phppgadmin.sourceforge.net>`_ or `PgAdmin <https://"
"www.pgadmin.org/download/?lang=fr_FR>`_ for PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"`phpPgAdmin <http://phppgadmin.sourceforge.net>`_ ali `PgAdmin <https://"
"www.pgadmin.org/download/?lang=fr_FR>`_ za PostgreSQL."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:72 18b9bb15bf7d4dd7ba45a1c5b79e1d8d
msgid "Web server directory exposition"
msgstr "Izložba imenika spletnega strežnika"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:76 37e62accde3b415cadbf85367a936766
msgid ""
"Galette installation may consists in copying a complete directory to a "
"location the web server can read. This method may work, but this exposes "
"from the web files and directories that should not be available this way."
msgstr ""
"Namestitev Galette lahko vključuje kopiranje celotnega imenika na lokacijo, "
"ki jo spletni strežnik lahko prebere. Ta metoda morda deluje, vendar s tem "
"razkrije spletne datoteke in imenike, ki na ta način ne bi smeli biti na "
"voljo."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:78 45c35ffe649746cba70af6c7eea6c637
msgid ""
"It is possible to limit that by exposing only the ``webroot`` directory. All "
"other directories are more safe: it is not possible to reach them from the "
"web server!"
msgstr ""
"To je mogoče omejiti tako, da se izpostavi samo imenik ``webroot``. Vsi "
"drugi imeniki so varnejši: do njih ni mogoče dostopati s spletnega strežnika!"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:82 a978ad7b5d5642d2a26463fc5f1379b5
msgid ""
"Exposing only ``webroot`` directory is the recommended, and only secured way."
msgstr ""
"Priporočen in edini varen način je, da se prikaže samo imenik ``webroot``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:85 54bb017b6aaf4b1eb394c2d09d7533c8
msgid "Using a subdomain"
msgstr "Uporaba poddomene"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:87 f23214d559a444688fd7432b7cbbaf7c
msgid ""
"Here is a virtual host configuration example, including the hide of "
"`index.php`:"
msgstr ""
"Tukaj je primer konfiguracije virtualnega gostitelja, vključno s skritim "
"delom datoteke `index.php`:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:114 b8edbd4f9b7042fcba445c713af742c0
msgid "Nginx would be:"
msgstr "Nginx bi bil:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:155 602cc27c13d0462ab3ddae057161baf3
msgid "Using an alias"
msgstr "Uporaba vzdevka"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:157 b5f8be49ca9b409ebd4666ff106cf4a3
msgid ""
"An alternative secured configuration, if you do not have a specific "
"subdomain for Galette is to use an ``alias`` in your existing virtual host:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativna varna konfiguracija, če nimate določene poddomene za Galette, "
"je uporaba »vzdevka« v vašem obstoječem virtualnem gostitelju:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:176 5a07bc26ebbd491aad9196ce54d23bec
msgid ""
"Do not forget with that solution you have to setup correctly your "
"``RewriteBase`` directive."
msgstr ""
"Ne pozabite, da morate pri tej rešitvi pravilno nastaviti direktivo "
"``RewriteBase``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:181 38034f385000466c9bbea8a5b5b6e542
msgid "Linux/Unix"
msgstr "Linux/Unix"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:183 370f999d6b3f48b3a3d887f3eff2df06
msgid ""
"Installing Galette on Linux implies you have an access to the terminal on "
"the server and required ACLs on directories."
msgstr ""
"Namestitev Galette v Linux pomeni, da imate dostop do terminala na strežniku "
"in zahtevane ACL-je v imenikih."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:185 e9375ca06c5444ebb3a6a8e3689a3637
msgid ""
"As an example, on `Fedora <https://fedora.org>`_, you will run (as root):"
msgstr "Na primer, v `Fedori <https://fedora.org>`_ boste zagnali (kot root):"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:192 837dde2933324f599e52cbb510fa171b
msgid ""
"Under `Debian <https://debian.org/>`_, we'll replace ``apache:apache`` with "
"``www-data:www-data``."
msgstr ""
"V imeniku `Debian <https://debian.org/>`_ bomo ``apache:apache`` zamenjali z "
"``www-data:www-data``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:194 7e65e82114f74f558565bad8a7762176
msgid "On SELinux enabled systems, we'll also add:"
msgstr "V sistemih, ki podpirajo SELinux, bomo dodali tudi:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:202 4cc4efa142a94071be7ec0d1ea6d2db8
msgid ""
"You will also have to authorize webserver to connect to the network, with a "
"SELinux boolean:"
msgstr ""
"Prav tako boste morali pooblastiti spletni strežnik za povezavo z omrežjem z "
"logično vrednostjo SELinux:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:211 d5eec4271a3c4eda9e2f02dde3919819
msgid "FTP"
msgstr "FTP"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:215 b57906d401ec41a688606efa2a7e110f
msgid ""
"Some archive or FTP software may corrupt files... It is strongly advised if "
"you use windows that you use `7zip <https://www.7-zip.fr>`_ to uncompress "
"and `FileZilla <https://filezilla-project.org/>`_ for FTP transfers."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri programi za arhiviranje ali FTP lahko poškodujejo datoteke ... Če "
"uporabljate Windows, vam toplo priporočamo, da za razpakiranje uporabite "
"`7zip <https://www.7-zip.fr>`_ in `FileZilla <https://filezilla-project.org/"
">`_ za prenose TFP."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:217 ad2c7a97f8eb4e0cb9639d394ff92758
msgid ""
"Once source code has been retrieved locally, use :samp:`tar xjvf "
"{galette.tar.bz2}` command under Linux/Unix/MacOS or a graphical tool under "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Ko je izvorna koda pridobljena lokalno, uporabite ukaz :samp:`tar xjvf "
"{galette.tar.bz2}` v sistemih Linux/Unix/MacOS ali grafično orodje v sistemu "
"Windows."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:219 a9fc115c646949a6889146fab12d3bb6
msgid ""
"Just copy the uncompressed directory obtained, and all its sub directories "
"and files, with your FTP client."
msgstr ""
"Preprosto kopirajte pridobljeni nestisnjen imenik in vse njegove podimenike "
"in datoteke s svojim FTP odjemalcem."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:226 d923d1f3678b452d996b6209b42d961e
msgid "Specific cases"
msgstr "Posebni primeri"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:229 2aa5519f36ac408fb72b250aeb58bf7c
msgid "Ionos"
msgstr "Ionos"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:231 4e067138825e4a1683c3134e72a4f90f
msgid ""
"If you're hosted on Ionos; and want to use a specific subdomain for Galette, "
"you must create your subdomain from their UI, and make it points to the "
"``webroot`` directory. You also have to edit the ``.htaccess`` file it "
"contains, and uncomment the ``RewriteBase /`` directive."
msgstr ""
"Če gostujete na Ionosu in želite za Galette uporabiti določeno poddomeno, "
"morate ustvariti svojo poddomeno iz njihovega uporabniškega vmesnika in jo "
"usmeriti na imenik ``webroot``. Urediti morate tudi datoteko ``.htaccess``, "
"ki jo vsebuje, in odstraniti komentarje iz direktive ``RewriteBase /``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:234 3157f0c662a1403683926300cc1f6509
msgid "OVH"
msgstr "OVH"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:236 7105479146614aaaafec0ae8963d44d5
msgid ""
"This hosting company offers to `change PHP version you use from your "
"customer account <https://docs.ovh.com/fr/hosting/configurer-le-php-sur-son-"
"hebergement-web-mutu-2014/>`_."
msgstr ""
"To podjetje za gostovanje ponuja možnost »spremembe različice PHP, ki jo "
"uporabljate, iz vašega uporabniškega računa <https://docs.ovh.com/fr/hosting/"
"configurer-le-php-sur-son-hebergement-web-mutu-2014/>«."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:238 64cfb89d9cdc475faa053bca41677e4d
msgid ""
"Additional information are available at: https://docs.ovh.com/fr/fr/web/"
"hosting/configurer-le-php-sur-son-hebergement-web-mutu-2014/"
msgstr ""
"Dodatne informacije so na voljo na: https://docs.ovh.com/fr/fr/web/hosting/"
"configurer-le-php-sur-son-hebergement-web-mutu-2014/"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:242 4bf152be97c34a9ba2b6af88dfcb8195
msgid ""
"Many users have display images or attendance sheet issues on OVH hosts. The "
"solution to this issue is to create a ``.ovhconfig`` file at your hosting "
"root with the following contents:"
msgstr ""
"Mnogi uporabniki imajo težave s prikazom slik ali listom prisotnosti na "
"gostiteljih OVH. Rešitev te težave je ustvariti datoteko ``.ovhconfig`` v "
"korenskem imeniku vašega gostovanja z naslednjo vsebino:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:249 633150f3fc1d411287bd62fc2093f7e8
msgid "Nginx"
msgstr "Nginx"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:251 bcbd7c34573c4be8ae4758fa43adf31c
msgid ""
"`Nginx webserver <https://nginx.com>`_ configuration is different from "
"Apache one (see `Nginx documentation for a more complete explanation "
"<https://www.nginx.com/resources/wiki/start/topics/examples/likeapache-"
"htaccess/>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracija spletnega strežnika Nginx <https://nginx.com>`_ se razlikuje "
"od konfiguracije strežnika Apache (za popolnejšo razlago glejte "
"dokumentacijo Nginx <https://www.nginx.com/resources/wiki/start/topics/"
"examples/likeapache-htaccess/>`_)."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:253 63ed36be97604fd3b2447e74e137d017
msgid ""
"So you have to convert restriction access files in Nginx configuration, as "
"for example:"
msgstr ""
"Torej morate pretvoriti datoteke z omejitvami dostopa v konfiguraciji Nginx, "
"na primer:"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:264 bd9b71d5e7e14eeba16d180a2464c34b
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:266 105ead040bdb4d35a0d7f81328638736
msgid ""
"Installation described here rely on `XAMPP <https://www.apachefriends.org/"
"xampp-windows.html>`_; other installation methods exist but are not listed "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Namestitev, opisana tukaj, temelji na `XAMPP <https://www.apachefriends.org/"
"xampp-windows.html>`_; obstajajo tudi drugi načini namestitve, vendar tukaj "
"niso navedeni."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:268 fc2bbae60a2d4e748437443c67859539
msgid ""
"First of all, download XAMPP on your computer. Let's install it under ``C:"
"\\xampp``."
msgstr ""
"Najprej prenesite XAMPP na svoj računalnik. Namestimo ga v mapo ``C:"
"\\xampp``."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:274 f92f30cc8f474862a9f13f9e78463688
msgid ""
"Launch the ``xampp-control`` executable (you can find it in ``C:\\xampp``), "
"so you can start Apache and MySQL services."
msgstr ""
"Zaženite izvedljivo datoteko ``xampp-control`` (najdete jo v mapi ``C:"
"\\xampp``), da lahko zaženete storitve Apache in MySQL."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:280 6f85ca76f72c478fa3ebbdd16eb830c5
msgid ""
"Once those steps done, download galette and move it to ``C:"
"\\wampp\\htdocs\\galette``, web application will be available from http://"
"127.0.0.1/galette/. Just visit this URL so the installation process begin."
msgstr ""
"Ko so ti koraki opravljeni, prenesite galette in ga premaknite v mapo ``C:"
"\\wampp\\htdocs\\galette``. Spletna aplikacija bo na voljo na naslovu http://"
"127.0.0.1/galette/. Obiščite ta URL, da se postopek namestitve začne."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:284 245167ff5940457a9436bd183dd49938
msgid ""
"Enabling PHP modules under XAMPP is done in ``xampp/php/php.ini``. Most of "
"the required extensions are already present, but commented (line begins with "
"a \";\"), just uncomment them and restart XAMPP."
msgstr ""
"Omogočanje PHP modulov v XAMPP se izvede v datoteki ``xampp/php/php.ini``. "
"Večina potrebnih razširitev je že prisotnih, vendar komentiranih (vrstica se "
"začne z \";\"), zato jih preprosto odkomentirajte in znova zaženite XAMPP."

#: ../installation/preparation.rst:286 3649e5d120b3490aa12153a6ebe8e626
msgid ""
"`openssl` extension is missing in the file, to activate it just add the "
"following to your `php.ini`: ``extension=php_openssl.dll``"
msgstr ""
"V datoteki manjka razširitev `openssl`. Za aktivacijo preprosto dodajte v "
"datoteko `php.ini` naslednje: ``extension=php_openssl.dll``"
